{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-22","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2253"},"reason":"Card tp-110 is about the German edition: added that German Playboy (editor-in-chief Florian Boitin) said it would stay nude when the US edition dropped nudity. The Russian text said 'a little over a year'; it now matches EN/DE ('barely a year').","by":"handcheck-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.promiflash.de/news/2015/10/14/nach-umbruch-in-den-usa-deutscher-playboy-bleibt-ganz-nackt.html"},{"url":"https://www.vienna.at/schluss-mit-nackt-der-playboy-wird-zuechtig/4484659"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",334],["+","German edition did not follow: its editor-in-chief Florian Boitin declared that the German Playboy would stay nude. The "],["=",301]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",348],["+","Die deutsche Ausgabe zog nicht mit: Chefredakteur Florian Boitin erklärte, der deutsche Playboy bleibe nackt. "],["=",293]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",304],["+","Немецкое издание этому примеру не последовало: главный редактор Флориан Бойтин заявил, что немецкий Playboy по-прежнему будет публиковать обнажённую натуру. "],["=",4],["-","чуть"],["+","едва"],["=",1],["-","больше"],["+","ли"],["=",1],["-","года."],["+","год."],["=",272]]}],"hash":"34b861f890a9"},
